# Backend environment template.
#
# The backend currently requires NO environment variables and reads none at
# runtime (there are no os.getenv/os.environ lookups in backend/app/).
#
# OPENCHARGEMAP_API_KEY was removed along with the Open Charge Map integration
# (backend/app/services/open_charge_map_provider.py and the /api/openchargemap/*
# endpoints). Do not reintroduce it.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder so that future configuration has an
# obvious, documented home. Copy it to backend/.env if you add variables.
